        <p style="color:var(--ink-muted); font-size:var(--fs-small); margin-top: var(--space-3);"><strong>Key learning:</strong> Breaking a scenario into triage steps, clear communication, and a documented decision framework holds up better under scrutiny than general advice.</p>
