        <h3>Africa Rising: VA Program &amp; Content Repurposing</h3>
        <p>Designed a workflow automation system for a virtual assistant program. Documented onboarding, content repurposing pipelines, and quality checkpoints for a growing remote team.</p>
        <p style="color:var(--ink-muted); font-size:var(--fs-small); margin-top: var(--space-3);"><strong>Key learning:</strong> Workflow automation and content repurposing systems save 60%+ of manual effort while maintaining quality.</p>
