      <article class="card reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Execution Framework</span>
        <h3>Ecosystem Manager: Structuring 72-Hour Execution</h3>
        <p>Framework for operators who must move without perfect information. Removes decision paralysis through tight scoping, asynchronous decision logs, and parallel-track execution.</p>
        <p style="color:var(--ink-muted); font-size:var(--fs-small); margin-top: var(--space-3);"><strong>Key learning:</strong> Tight scoping and asynchronous decision logs make the 72-hour window survivable when information is incomplete.</p>
