      <article class="card reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">CEO-Level Communication</span>
        <h3>Sohubox Strategies: EA to the CEO Written Exercise</h3>
        <p>Written exercise demonstrating the operating cadence, communication patterns, and stakeholder mapping I'd bring to a CEO-level EA role. Shows tone calibration and organisational voice.</p>
        <p style="color:var(--ink-muted); font-size:var(--fs-small); margin-top: var(--space-3);"><strong>Key learning:</strong> Tone calibration matters as much as content. The same update lands differently depending on whether the organisation's voice is formal or conversational.</p>
